@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@token = INSIRA_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Listar Peças
GET {{baseUrl}}/parts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar Peça
POST {{baseUrl}}/parts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Filtro de Óleo",
  "price": 45.00,
  "stockQuantity": 10
}
